# The 58503B's 1 PPS divider and sync blocks, each the Z3805A's
# (58503b-trace.md, "The 1 PPS divider" and "The sync field"), checked
# by `make -f tools/fpga/Makefile check-blocks` (blockmatch.py).
#
# The divider: GI, the prescaler and its terminal, KH to KK, the three
# decades and the terminal count HH.
pair GI
pair IG
pair JH
pair IH
pair JI
pair II
pair HI
pair FJ
pair KH
pair KI
pair KJ
pair KK
pair JJ
pair IJ
pair JK
pair KF
pair KG
pair JG
pair GE
pair GF
pair HF
pair GG
pair HG
pair HH
# The prescaler's terminal a clock later, the Z3805A's HJ.
pair LJ HJ
# The sync field's register, its copy a clock behind, the restart, the
# pending sync, the step lines and the prescaler's carry.
pair DI
pair DJ
pair EJ
pair EK
pair GJ
pair GK
# What those read from outside them: DH, the GPS 1 PPS's rising-edge
# detector, with its two flip-flops exchanged (the 58503A's, which
# 58503b-58503a-z3801a.match pairs as it is); EL, the register-3 write
# decode; FL, FK and HL, the write strobe from the select and R/W.  The
# rest these read are pads, the same pins in both, and GCLK.
pair DH
pair EL
pair FL
pair FK
pair HL
# HH's two outputs are exchanged: the terminal on JG.X is HH.Y here and
# HH.X in the Z3805A.
rename HH.X HH.Y
rename HH.Y HH.X
rename DH.QX DH.QY
rename DH.QY DH.QX
